---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About VR Entertainment" description="Learn about VR Entertainment's mission, values and approach to artist development, production and marketing in India's entertainment economy.">
  <section class="bg-background px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[840px]">
      <h1 class="font-display text-[52px] leading-tight text-text-primary">About VR Entertainment</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-[18px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">A premium creative company built for India's entertainment economy.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-surface px-6 py-[100px] lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[840px] space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[32px] font-display text-text-primary">Why we exist</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.9]">
          <p class="font-display italic text-text-primary">India's entertainment industry is growing faster than its infrastructure. Independent artists are building real audiences with no career support around them. We started VR Entertainment to change that.</p>
          <p class="font-display italic text-text-primary">We work at the intersection of artist development, content production, and digital marketing — because those three things are inseparable. A great artist with poor content and no marketing strategy will not reach their potential. We hold all three.</p>
          <p class="font-display italic text-text-primary">We are based in Bangalore. We work across India. We are building toward a global practice — starting with the artists and brands that are defining what Indian entertainment looks like next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-8">
          <p class="text-[16px] font-[500] text-text-primary">We work with very few clients at a time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-8">
          <p class="text-[16px] font-[500] text-text-primary">We measure our work by your outcomes, not our outputs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-8">
          <p class="text-[16px] font-[500] text-text-primary">We understand the Indian entertainment market from the inside.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6 rounded-[6px] border border-border bg-background p-8">
        <div class="text-[16px] font-display italic text-text-primary">Selectivity</div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We'd rather do exceptional work for three clients than average work for thirty.</p>
        <div class="text-[16px] font-display italic text-text-primary">Accountability</div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We track outcomes, not just activity.</p>
        <div class="text-[16px] font-display italic text-text-primary">Cultural fluency</div>
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.8] text-text-secondary font-[300]">We understand India's entertainment landscape because we live in it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex rounded-[8px] border border-accent px-8 py-4 text-[14px] font-[500] text-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-background transition duration-300 ease-in-out">Work with us →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
